  "description": "Frame and Fork The All Road Elite is the same stout Gravel grinder as the trusty All Road with more options. Bigger, stiffer, faster. From epic cross races to long miles on the tarmac, to trail-bound single track. Add to that list a low-profile rack mounts, and you can be confident that this will be your go-to bike to for any and all kinds of riding. Throw a rack on the back and gear up for a bike-packing adventure or hook on a pannier for zipping around the city or for your daily commute. Ridden with slick 28mm tires, the All Road Elite will surprise you with its nimble control. Throw on some knobbies (clearance for 45mm tires) and gobble up single track or gravel grinding hill climbs. Each bike is made by hand at our workshop in Brooklyn, NY. Wait times fluctuate so please inquire on timing. COMES WITH YOUR CHOICE OF ANY SINGLE COLOR PAINT AND LOGOS! CHECK OUT HORSE CYCLES PAINT FOR IDEAS SPECS AND UPGRADES BELOW",
